  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(500, 450, 400)\n\n(600, 550, 500)\n\n**Logic: **[(First no.), (First no. - 50), (First no. - 100)]\n\n(500, 450, 400) → [(500), (500 - 50), (500 - 100)]\n\n(600, 550, 500) → [(600), (600 - 50), (600 - 100)]\n\nChecking all the given options:\n\n1. (800, 750, 650) → [(800), (800 - 50), (800 - 150)]\n\n2. (350, 300, 200) → [(350), (350 - 50), (350 - 150)]\n\n3. (300, 350, 200) → [(300), (300 + 50), (300 - 100)]\n\n4. (400, 350, 300) → [(400), (400 - 50), (400 - 100)]\n\nHere,** (400, 350, 300) **is showing a similar relation to the given set of numbers.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (4)\".",
